Description: classic Platinum desktop for Wayland
 Platinum 2026 is a desktop in the style of a late-1990s Platinum
 interface: a wlroots compositor that draws Platinum window frames,
 a menu bar, a spatial Finder and control panels, with original fonts,
 icons, cursors, desktop patterns and sounds.
 .
 It installs a "Platinum 2026" session for login managers, and the
 platinum-session command for starting it from a text console.
